                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/373: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lay</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-07-03T09:00:00-06:00">July 3, 1930—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>57. The draft protocol of agreement transmitted in Department’s instruction No. 1
                    of May 21 was submitted to the Honduran Government yesterday.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Managua.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lay</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
